{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! The world is flooded. But this is no time to give up hope. Build a ship and explore the remains! A variety of different islands await you. Some yield resources, some are home to unique characters. No timers, explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/0428536f24222483a06f0ebb2dd5dbca.poster.avif?t=1757770016\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/0428536f24222483a06f0ebb2dd5dbca.webm?t=1757770016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/0428536f24222483a06f0ebb2dd5dbca.mp4?t=1757770016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your Ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all kinds of resources and recycle them to build the ship of your dreams. Grow and farm your own plants on board and convert them into bio-fuel. Or will you build a ship that's powered by sunlight or wind? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/92850d25cac79e8bf5186d3f8243f764.poster.avif?t=1757770016\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/92850d25cac79e8bf5186d3f8243f764.webm?t=1757770016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/92850d25cac79e8bf5186d3f8243f764.mp4?t=1757770016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Connections</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world inhibits several unique characters. Get to know them and help each other out! Share your skills and you might get something in return. Together you can build a wholesome community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/5af3b48a9cd2e6773afde9153e1f288f.poster.avif?t=1757770016\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/5af3b48a9cd2e6773afde9153e1f288f.webm?t=1757770016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/5af3b48a9cd2e6773afde9153e1f288f.mp4?t=1757770016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Document your Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with a photo camera, you can make travel memories. Catalogue birds, plants, characters or just take some snapshots of pretty vistas. They all get saved into your personal journal. In the end, it\u2019s your very own journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/39714f10c04465f1ad3d8cd1ddb199b1.poster.avif?t=1757770016\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/39714f10c04465f1ad3d8cd1ddb199b1.webm?t=1757770016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/39714f10c04465f1ad3d8cd1ddb199b1.mp4?t=1757770016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430280?t=1757770016","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757770016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/224e47fea05b0c3e6a3b6cf3894661fe26173880/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757770016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/224e47fea05b0c3e6a3b6cf3894661fe26173880/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757770016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cozy Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! The world is flooded. But this is no time to give up hope. Build a ship and explore the remains! A variety of different islands await you. Some yield resources, some are home to unique characters. No timers, explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/0428536f24222483a06f0ebb2dd5dbca.poster.avif?t=1757770016\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/0428536f24222483a06f0ebb2dd5dbca.webm?t=1757770016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430280/extras/0428536f24222483a06f0ebb2dd5dbca.mp4?t=1757770016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your Ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all kinds of resources and recycle them to build the ship of your dreams. Grow and farm your own plants on board and convert them int